tools: muldiv op and through-form across the rule compiler (Mudb0y 7760e07)

Ports the compiler half of thousandths support: decompile emits
delta_muldiv calls; emit/lower/patterns carry the MULDIV op end to
end; upper accepts statement-record locations, the through pointer
form, scale/truncate/multiply/divide say-forms, short call args,
and a dispatch that tolerates backtrack-nothing-planted. Verified
by build green + identical gate (no current rule uses the forms).

